msgid "Avoid inferring identity, delivery, verification or execution from missing source evidence."
msgstr "避免根据缺失的来源证据推断身份、交付、验证或执行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reactionState|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain exact source values, their scope and attribution; preserve supplied language and base direction."
msgstr "保留精确来源值、范围和归属，并保持所提供的语言和基本方向。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reactionState|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Independent source claims coexist. These declarations preserve evidence without authenticating the provider or executing its operation."
msgstr "独立的来源主张可以并存。这些声明保留证据，不认证提供方，也不执行其操作。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reactionState|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain the supplied value for gmeow:reactionState."
msgstr "保留 gmeow:reactionState 的来源值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reactionPlaced|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reaction placed"
msgstr "反应已添加"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reactionPlaced|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source reports that the reaction was placed on its scoped target message. This value does not establish current presence across other events or standpoints."
msgstr "来源报告已将反应添加到限定范围的目标消息。此值不证明其在其他事件或立场下当前仍然存在。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reactionPlaced|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source explicitly supplies this record or field."
msgstr "用于来源明确提供此记录或字段时。"

