msgid "Independent source claims coexist. These declarations preserve evidence without authenticating the provider or executing its operation."
msgstr "独立的来源主张可以并存。这些声明保留证据，不认证提供方，也不执行其操作。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reactionPlaced|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain the supplied value for gmeow:reactionPlaced."
msgstr "保留 gmeow:reactionPlaced 的来源值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reactionRemoved|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reaction removed"
msgstr "反应已移除"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reactionRemoved|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source reports that the reaction was taken off its scoped target message. This does not erase the placement record or infer that another source agreed."
msgstr "来源报告已从限定范围的目标消息移除反应。这不删除添加记录，也不推断其他来源同意。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reactionRemoved|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source explicitly supplies this record or field."
msgstr "用于来源明确提供此记录或字段时。"

