msgstr "保留 gmeow:reactionRemoved 的来源值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/actorIdentity|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "actor identity as recorded"
msgstr "记录的行为者标识"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/actorIdentity|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact transport string naming who acted or sent the source content. It is provider-, transport- and context-scoped evidence, not a resolved Agent, account holder or message sender relation."
msgstr "传输记录中指明行为者或内容发送方的精确字符串。它是限定提供方、传输网络和情境的证据，不是已解析的 Agent、账户持有人或消息发送者关系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/actorIdentity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source explicitly supplies this record or field."
msgstr "用于来源明确提供此记录或字段时。"

