msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RejectedMediaSourceEvidenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read the canonical formula against actual source identities and preserve competing attributed records."
msgstr "根据实际来源身份读取规范公式，并保留相互竞争的带归属记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RejectedMediaSourceEvidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Independent source claims coexist. These declarations preserve evidence without authenticating the provider or executing its operation."
msgstr "独立的来源主张可以并存。这些声明保留证据，不认证提供方，也不执行其操作。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RejectedMediaSourceEvidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this source law: gmeow:RejectedMediaSourceEvidenceConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:RejectedMediaObservation ."
msgstr "保留此来源法则：gmeow:RejectedMediaSourceEvidenceConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:RejectedMediaObservation ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RejectedMediaSourceEvidenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/message"
msgid "A rejection observation retains its actual source feature and derivation, the source actor and original provider-time text, and the same provider, transport and source context as that feature. Its observer and method remain distinct from sender identity."
msgstr "拒绝观察保留实际来源观察对象和派生、来源行为者、原始提供方时间文本，以及与该对象相同的提供方、传输网络和来源情境。观察者和方法区别于发送者身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RejectedMediaPartObservationConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Rejected part observation constraint"
msgstr "被拒部分观察约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RejectedMediaPartObservationConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every refused-part descriptor is an actual result of a retained rejection observation, not an unattached media artifact or a delivered body part inferred from its description."
msgstr "每个被拒部分描述均是保留的拒绝观察的实际结果，而不是孤立媒体制品，也不是根据描述推断的已交付正文部分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RejectedMediaPartObservationConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check the explicitly retained source-record contract."
msgstr "用于检查明确保留的来源记录契约。"

