msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SessionVerificationEvidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Session verification evidence constraint"
msgstr "会话验证证据约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SessionVerificationEvidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Supplied session-verification identifiers belong to an actual Observation retaining both session and sender strings, its feature, observer, method, held result and source evidence. This checks the recorded claim, not cryptographic authenticity."
msgstr "所提供会话验证标识属于实际 Observation，并保留会话和发送者字符串、观察对象、观察者、方法、持有结果及来源证据。此检查针对记录主张，不认证密码学真实性。"

